        "body": "DDB Chicago obligations rose from $348M in FY21 to $596M in FY23, then fell to $399M in FY24 and $391M in FY25 before reaching $303M in FY26. FY26 is a fiscal year to date total, and obligations are down 22.4% year over year. The sequence shows a peak in FY23 followed by a decline through FY26."
